From: Scott Miller <152090551+seelesturm@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 00:13:45 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] fix(ui): report failed window captures

Deliver failed map, range and decoding results through the capture completion channel. Keep repainting until consumption and isolate obsolete callbacks after a timeout.

Co-Authored-By: Coder <coder@users.noreply.github.com>

Fixes #2745
